---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Legal Notice / Imprint"
  description="Legal notice for Vihren Labs — operated by Vihren Labs Ltd. (ЕООД), EIK 208843549, registered in Sofia, Bulgaria."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-white/85">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="line-number text-orange uppercase">/imprint</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-2">Legal Notice</h1>
      <p class="text-white/50 mt-3">Imprint / Impressum — operator and contact details</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This website, <a href="https://www.vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">vihrenlabs.com</a>,
        and the digital products sold under the Vihren Labs brand are operated by:
      </p>

      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-6 bg-white/[0.02] space-y-1">
        <p class="text-white font-semibold text-lg">Vihren Labs Ltd.</p>
        <p>Bulgarian limited liability company (ЕООД / EOOD)</p>
        <p>Company number (EIK / ЕИК): <strong>208843549</strong></p>
        <p>Registered address: Sofia 1700, ul. Yana Yazova 7, Bulgaria</p>
        <p>Represented by: Petko Petkov, Manager</p>
        <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Vihren Labs Ltd. is registered in the Bulgarian Commercial Register maintained by the
        Registry Agency. The company is the seller and, where applicable, the data controller for
        information collected through this site — see the
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-orange hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">VAT</h2>
      <p>
        Where a VAT identification number applies to a sale, it is shown on the invoice issued for
        that order. For VAT or invoicing questions, email
        <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">Storefronts</h2>
      <p>
        Products are sold through <a href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/FreelancebyPetko" class="text-orange hover:underline">Etsy</a>
        and <a href="https://vihrenlabs.gumroad.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">Gumroad</a>. Each storefront's
        own terms and seller information also apply to purchases made there, alongside this notice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white pt-4">Responsibility for content</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site is provided for general information about Vihren Labs products and
        operator practice. It is prepared with care but does not constitute legal, tax, or other
        professional advice. External links point to third-party sites whose content is the
        responsibility of their respective operators.
      </p>

      <p class="pt-8 text-white/50 text-sm border-t border-white/10 mt-12">
        Questions about this notice or the operating entity:
        <a href="mailto:hello@vihrenlabs.com" class="text-orange hover:underline">hello@vihrenlabs.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-content a { word-break: break-word; }
  .prose-content h2 { letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
</style>
